## break
`break` exits a loop immediately:

```qc
for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
    if (i == 5) break;
    qout("%i", i);
}
// 0, 1, 2, 3, 4
```

## continue
`continue` skips to the next iteration:

```qc
for (int i = 0; i < 6; i++) {
    if (i == 3) continue;
    qout("%i", i);
}
// 0, 1, 2, 4, 5
```


